cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Athena Research — Tabular AI Decision-Making"
abstract: >-
  Controlled experiments on reasoning topology, semantic context, and model capability in LLM-assisted
  decisions for tabular machine learning: a retrospective on a typed bounded-decision model (JEV), Studies A and B
  with a local 7B model, their frontier replications A2 and B2, a cross-study comparison, and a pre-registered
  council ablation (model councils against a strong single model on ML-governance questions).
